WEBVTT

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:03.950
This is an SCM.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.450
It's a device that turns people into slaves.

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:10.370
You want a slave that bad?

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.040
I know you'll understand.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.000
I want to test myself.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.580
Kabuki-cho Ichiban-machi

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
-shackles-

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:23.950
Okay, I'll throw scissors, and you'll throw rock.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.660
You want me to lose on purpose, right?

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.790
Yeah, that's right.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:32.000
Ready?

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.410
Rock...

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:35.120
Paper...

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.080
Scissors!

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:37.450
Huh?

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.450
Wha... why?!

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:45.370
Hey, Seiya?

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.370
I knew...

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:50.370
...about the SCM.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:54.540
Sorry.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:33.160
Ayaka
Toshima

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.750
Why...

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.790
I heard the rumors online...

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:45.830
You little--!

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:48.370
You promised you'd lose on purpose!

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:49.620
Sit.

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:52.450
Sit, Seiya.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.660
- Slaves cannot disobey their master's orders.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.660
- Slaves cannot lie to their masters.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:03.160
Hey, Seiya, can I ask you something?

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:08.370
I've done a whole lot for you, haven't I, Seiya?

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.200
You got to be the number one host

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:15.410
because I always requested you
and spent so much money on you.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.290
So why?

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:21.370
Why did you try to make me your slave?

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:28.450
I was tired of having to treat you all special.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:34.200
- Slaves cannot lie to their masters,
even if what they say may hurt their masters.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:34.200
I was so sick of comforting you when you cried,
and kissing up to you...

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:40.290
If I used an SCM on you,
I could get you to shut up and just give me money...

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:45.000
What did you do with the money I gave you?

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.790
I bought a motorcycle and a computer.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.500
I went on a trip with my girlfriend.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:55.160
You said you went on that trip by yourself,
but you went with your girlfriend.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:57.160
Yeah.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.450
I don't care about you having a girlfriend.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:01.410
It was all a lie anyway.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:06.410
But Seiya, just tell me this.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:09.200
What was I to you?

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:14.500
A disgusting human ATM.

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.500
The hardest thing...

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.160
...is waking up from this dream.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:31.410
You know, I worked multiple jobs for you, Seiya.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.910
I command you.

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:41.120
Eat me out.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.410
She's worked real hard for you.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:47.870
Give her the praise she deserves.

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:57.830
Oh, Seiya...

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:00.080
My dear Seiya.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:05.290
I want to stay in this dream so badly.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:08.660
I don't want to wake up.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:14.500
1. Masters cannot command their slave to commit
an action that would lead to their death.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:14.500
2. Masters cannot manipulate
the emotions of their slave.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:14.120
Masters cannot manipulate their slave's emotions.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:19.040
Seiya's heart still isn't mine.

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:22.200
But I'll get it eventually.

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:26.450
Oh, Seiya,

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.500
I love you.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.580
I used the SCM to keep my dream alive.

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:42.290
Now nobody can butt into our love story...

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.250
YUUGA OHTA
Gonna be a little late

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.000
Shinnosuke
Incoming call

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.540
Sorry for the wait.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.500
So, what's the plan?

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:36.620
I've found our first opponent.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:40.870
I've been using the movements on the
map to look for someone.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.080
Map?

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.330
Yeah, check this out.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:47.540
What is it?

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:57.910
This map shows the position of anyone wearing an SCM.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:00.540
The square symbol means "Initialized".

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:04.370
Basically, an SCM that's never made someone a slave.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:10.370
Master

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:10.370
Slaves are triangles, and masters are circles.

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:14.950
If people can just look you up with this,
you're probably better off not wearing it, huh.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:21.290
Yeah, but the map radius is only a few kilometers,

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.950
so it's not like wearing an SCM would mean
someone would always find you.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:26.870
So how'd you find this opponent?

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:33.120
When two people wearing SCMs get close enough,
a vibrating alert goes off.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.700
My proximity alarm went off when I was in Kabuki-cho,

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:40.370
so I looked up who it was.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:43.750
So you went wandering around wearing an SCM?

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.250
That doesn't sound safe.

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:48.250
No risk, no reward.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:53.620
We're gonna duel them, huh...

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:57.910
Seiya!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.830
I look forward to living with you!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:10.660
Today's our first day living together, Seiya!

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:12.750
Is this my room?

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:14.040
So cute!

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:17.330
Oh, but I wanna change the curtains,
and get a clock to match the room's colors...

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.160
And I get to use this closet!

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:25.330
So, why are that woman's things still here?

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:27.620
I told you to break up with her, didn't I?

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:29.370
Well, it was just so sudden,

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:32.160
so I said I'd hold onto this stuff
till she found a new place...

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:34.790
Send them to her parents' place, then!

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:41.200
She doesn't have a mom or dad...

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:43.080
Please, just-

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.540
Then throw them out! Right now!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:47.910
All of it!

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:51.410
I command you!

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:57.540
I'm going to work now.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:58.410
Okay.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.250
Maybe I was too harsh...

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.660
Today's supposed to be a special day for us, too...

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:16.790
Congrats on becoming No. 1!

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.580
I know!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:20.950
Welcome!

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.910
Since it's our special day,
I've gotta spend time with him!

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:33.120
Seiya!

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:36.540
Guys are so hot when they're working...

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.290
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:43.660
It's okay, don't worry about it!

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.330
Want something to drink?

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.370
Yeah, let's see...

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.790
A vibration?! That means...

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:54.870
A proximity alert...

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:58.660
Someone wearing an SCM is close by!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.200
Seiya Shinjuku and Ayaka Toshima.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:11.580
We're here to challenge you to a duel.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:24.950
We're here to challenge you to a duel.

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:27.500
I'm Yuuga Ohta.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.750
I'm Eia Arakawa.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:32.540
What's with these two?

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:35.620
How do they know we're wearing SCMs?

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:39.580
I'm terribly sorry, but we do not accept.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:43.660
Just hold on a sec and listen to our proposal.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.660
We'll duel as a team, us against you two.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.910
The team who wins gets the losing team as their slaves.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:54.000
You can decide the method of our duel, Seiya.

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:58.790
Let's do this somewhere else.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:01.330
But before that, let us talk it over.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:07.200
What do you think, Seiya? Should we run away?

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:11.910
No, they must have looked us up before.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.450
If we ran, they'd probably still find us.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:16.250
Then what should we do?

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.080
Don't worry. I've got a good idea.

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:23.830
Seiya!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.500
Do you know the game Thumbs Up?

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.950
Thumbs up, one!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:37.450
On your turn, you try to predict the number of people
with their thumbs up, like I just showed you.

00:11:37.830 --> 00:11:40.500
If you're right, you remove one hand.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.410
Get it right twice and you're "out" of the game.

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:43.790
Alright.

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:48.620
So for our duel, the last team
with members still "in" is the loser.

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:50.370
Yeah, that works.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:54.160
It's okay, Seiya thought up a plan...

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:56.000
I just have to trust him.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:59.370
Why don't we start with Seiya
and go around counter-clockwise?

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:01.580
Not clockwise?

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.370
Yeah, just to be different.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:05.660
I'll start.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.830
Thumbs up...

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:09.790
Six!

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:11.410
Alright.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:12.950
Wow, Seiya!

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:14.370
I'm next.

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:15.830
Thumbs up...

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:16.700
Four!

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:17.700
Yes!

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:21.250
Thumbs up, one!

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:23.080
It's okay!

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:24.160
Shut up.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:28.410
My turn... but it's okay!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.250
We have a secret plan!

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:36.790
Seiya and I decided that on our turns,
we'll put all our thumbs up.

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:40.870
If we know how many we both will put up,
our chances of guessing right are way higher!

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:46.160
This game won't last a lot of turns,
so we'll win before they figure it out!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.580
Thumbs up...

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:48.450
Three!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:49.910
Yay!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.750
Go win it for us, Seiya!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:56.160
Thumbs up, three!

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:59.160
Alright, I'm out!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.910
Just as we planned! Now all I have to do is win...

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:04.620
Wait...

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.580
If I'm the only one in,
then our plan is total meaningless...

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.450
What do I do now?

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:18.540
Seiya?

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:21.580
Thumbs up...

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:22.580
One!

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:24.160
I'm out!

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.080
You got this, Eia.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:27.410
Oh, shut it.
What do I do? I'm all on my own...

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:28.910
What do I do? I'm all on my own...

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.700
Thumbs up...

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:31.700
One.

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:34.750
Alright!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.660
What do I do? At this rate, I'm gonna...

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:38.790
Seiya!

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:41.290
Why does he look so uncaring?!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.500
2. Masters cannot manipulate
the emotions of their slave.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:44.500
Don't tell me...

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:48.000
He wants me to lose so he can get a new master?

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.000
Thumbs up,

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:53.040
Two!

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.000
I won't let him get away with that!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:58.200
I'll never let him get away with that!

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:00.500
Thumbs up,

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:01.410
zero!

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:03.660
Thumbs up, one!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.700
What is with this girl?

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:12.620
How can she be so calm right now?

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.370
You're gonna be my slave if you lose!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:18.160
You'll be a lowly slave who has to obey my commands!

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:22.830
Thumbs up, one!

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.870
What do I do? I'm gonna...

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:29.200
Seiya, help me...!

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:33.120
Please, help me!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:35.540
Thumbs up,

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.330
zero!

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:51.200
We win. That was intense.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.450
How?

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.450
How are you so calm?

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:02.700
I've got insurance.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:03.790
Insurance?

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:04.790
Yeah.

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:06.290
To tell the truth,

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:09.660
Eia's not wearing an SCM.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:14.910
If we lost, I'd be the only person who'd become a slave.

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:18.910
If that happened, Eia would get me out of it.

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.250
That's right.

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:24.870
Still, you've got no guarantee I'll save you.
I might betray you instead.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:27.700
It's alright. I trust you.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.370
If you keep saying that, you'll lose all your friends.

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:32.200
These two are close...
If you keep saying that, you'll lose all your friends.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.750
These two are close...
What? It's the truth.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:34.500
What? It's the truth.

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:37.120
But Seiya and I are...

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:41.950
Why?

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:45.040
Why are you taking Seiya from me?

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.080
If you hadn't showed up...

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:51.910
Seiya is supposed to be MINE!

00:15:52.290 --> 00:15:53.410
Ayaka.

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:05.870
I'm not yours...

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:07.160
...anymore.

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:08.870
Stop!

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.370
Seiya...

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:27.580
You can return to your normal lives
until I give you orders.

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:34.700
But you are not allowed to participate
in any duels with other SCM users.

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:39.200
Hey, Yuuga, why didn't you release them?

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:42.370
The SCM really works.

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:45.580
We really got ourselves our own slaves.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:48.250
Two at once, even!

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.660
Letting them go would be such a waste.

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:55.410
You said you weren't interested in getting slaves.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.700
I don't want to make them suffer or anything.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:02.580
Having extra pawns will give us
an advantage in the next duel.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.000
You get it right, Eia?

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.450
This is how the SCM game is played.

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.830
Yuuga Ohta
Here's a link to a map that shows

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:16.830
everyone wearing an SCM.
Link:

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.160
A map...?

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:22.000
Two slaves... me and Ayaka.

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:24.750
So that's how they were watching us...

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.450
Sorry I hit you.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:57.000
Seiya
Shinjuku

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:04.040
Yuuga ordered us, his slaves,
to return to our normal lives.

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.200
We're not free.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:10.410
We can't get back what we've lost.

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:15.000
Kabuki-cho is so peaceful today.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:21.540
I lost my freedom 'cause I got involved with SCMs...

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:24.580
...and I lost something dear to me, too.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:32.000
So dirty...

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:35.200
I drank like a fish...

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:40.080
tricked a girl, and finally got to be
the number one host...

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:41.660
Yet...

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.410
Look at me now.

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:48.000
You okay?

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:53.040
You'll catch a cold up here.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:18:59.790
Here, warm your hands.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:09.000
That was how I met Julia.

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:15.370
Will you go out with me?

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:17.700
Yeah.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.660
I wanted to make a happy life with her.

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.200
That's the reason why...

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:28.500
...I made that mistake.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:29.910
Why?!

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:31.660
I don't wanna break up with you!

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:34.580
If I did something wrong, I'll make it right!

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.250
Seiya!

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:40.910
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.500
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:51.200
When Ayaka came to my place and
made me throw away all of Julia's things,

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:53.700
I wanted so badly to murder her.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:59.120
But the SCM held back my anger and my grief.

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:02.370
That's when Yuuga showed up.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:05.620
I thought, I might be able to get away from Ayaka.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:10.370
So I pushed Ayaka to accept the duel.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:16.250
In the end, we lost,
and I escaped from Ayaka's control...

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:21.200
Though I guess I've just become someone else's slave...

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:25.160
I wish I could find her with this map...

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.700
Seiya.

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:40.370
Long time no see.

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:42.580
Julia!

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:45.830
Why?!

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:50.410
This is the place where you asked me out.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.580
Have you lost weight?

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.250
Yeah, I'm on a diet.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:59.330
I tried to call you and text you so many times...

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:03.250
Sorry, I can't use my phone much at my family's place.

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:06.200
What about work? Are you still at that place?

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.290
Yeah, I am.

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:10.000
You're lying...

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:12.750
Julia, why are you lying to me?!

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:17.290
As soon as I was released from Ayaka,
I went straight to your club,

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.250
but you weren't there!

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:23.080
Julia!

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:25.870
It's all my fault.

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:28.410
I'm not letting you go, not again!

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:29.700
Really?

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:31.250
I swear!

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:35.660
Then if you let go of my hand, you lose, okay?

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:37.370
Yeah, I'll bet on that.

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:39.080
Let's live together again!

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:43.500
Hey...

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:47.790
I met someone after you broke up with me.

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:49.410
Master Ryuuou.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:50.410
What?

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.580
It's written as "dragon" and "cherry blossom"...

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.160
...and pronounced "Ryuuou".

00:21:58.160 --> 00:21:59.830
I belong...

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:03.160
...to Master Ryuuou now.

00:22:18.410 --> 00:22:21.910
-shackles-

00:23:37.450 --> 00:23:42.410
-abuse-
